":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 004","label":"Unnamed Suit 004","target_id":"huntik:page:17523","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_004","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17523"},{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-137","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:7836","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-137","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7836"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 028","label":"Unnamed Suit 028","target_id":"huntik:page:17701","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_028","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17701"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 041","label":"Unnamed Suit 041","target_id":"huntik:page:26470","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_041","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A26470"},{"target_title":"Beta","label":"Beta","target_id":"huntik:page:26528","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Beta","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A26528"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 053","label":"Unnamed Suit 053","target_id":"huntik:page:26537","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_053","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A26537"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Home Turf]]\"","value_text":"\"Home Turf\"","links":[{"target_title":"Home Turf","label":"Home Turf","target_id":"huntik:page:3228","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Home_Turf","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3228"}]}],"start":0,"end":321}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"The spell was used by [[Unnamed Suit 028]] in [[Newgrange Passage Tomb]] to counter a [[Raypulse]] from [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{source|Home Turf}}\n\n[[Unnamed Suit 041]] used the spell to consume an [[Augerfrost]] attack from [[Lok Lambert]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n\n[[Beta]] used this spell to consume a [[Boltflare]] attack from [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|To Be Together}}\n\n[[Unnamed Suit 053]] used this spell in [[Peru]] to counter a [[Poisonfang|Raypulse]] attack from [[Zhalia Moon]], but Sophie's [[Shieldbreaker]] power disabled it, allowing Zhalia to hit the suit with a [[Poisonfang]] attack. {{source|Doorway to Huntik}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"The spell was used by Unnamed Suit 028 in Newgrange Passage Tomb to counter a Raypulse from Sophie Casterwill. [Home Turf]\n\nUnnamed Suit 041 used the spell to consume an Augerfrost attack from Lok Lambert. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nBeta used this spell to consume a Boltflare attack from Sophie Casterwill. [To Be Together]\n\nUnnamed Suit 053 used this spell in Peru to counter a Raypulse attack from Zhalia Moon, but Sophie's Shieldbreaker power disabled it, allowing Zhalia to hit the suit with a Poisonfang attack. [Doorway to Huntik]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT= Straalvreter\n|FR = Mange-éclair\n|POR=Devora-raios, Devorador, Devora-fogo}}","text":"Dutch: Straalvreter\nFrench: Mange-éclair\nPortuguese: Devora-raios, Devorador, Devora-fogo"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E13 Suits Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by [[Unnamed Suit 028]]\nS1E19 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by [[Unnamed Suit 041]]\nS2E27 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by one of [[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]]\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Green-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":"S1E13 Suits Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by Unnamed Suit 028\nS1E19 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by Unnamed Suit 041\nS2E27 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by one of Wilder's Suits"}],"full_text":"Blasteater is a defensive spell that manifests as a green aura shaped like a mouth with sharp teeth that opens up to consume oncoming attacks. It is typically used by members of the Organization.\n\n== History ==\nThe spell was used by Unnamed Suit 028 in Newgrange Passage Tomb to counter a Raypulse from Sophie Casterwill. [Home Turf]\n\nUnnamed Suit 041 used the spell to consume an Augerfrost attack from Lok Lambert. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nBeta used this spell to consume a Boltflare attack from Sophie Casterwill. [To Be Together]\n\nUnnamed Suit 053 used this spell in Peru to counter a Raypulse attack from Zhalia Moon, but Sophie's Shieldbreaker power disabled it, allowing Zhalia to hit the suit with a Poisonfang attack. [Doorway to Huntik]\n\n==International Names==\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E13 Suits Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by Unnamed Suit 028\nS1E19 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by Unnamed Suit 041\nS2E27 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by one of Wilder's Suits","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E19_Suit_Blasteater.png\n| aura  = Green<br>Blue ([[TCG:SAS-137|TCG]])\n| class = Protective\n| users = [[Rassimov]] <br>[[Suits]]<br> [[Unnamed Suit 004]] ([[TCG:SAS-137|TCG]]) [[Unnamed Suit 028]] <br> [[Unnamed Suit 041]]<br> [[Beta]]<br> [[Unnamed Suit 053]]\n| first = \"[[Home Turf]]\"\n}}'''Blasteater''' is a defensive spell that manifests as a green aura shaped like a mouth with sharp teeth that opens up to consume oncoming attacks. It is typically used by members of [[the Organization]].\n\n== History ==\nThe spell was used by [[Unnamed Suit 028]] in [[Newgrange Passage Tomb]] to counter a [[Raypulse]] from [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{source|Home Turf}}\n\n[[Unnamed Suit 041]] used the spell to consume an [[Augerfrost]] attack from [[Lok Lambert]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n\n[[Beta]] used this spell to consume a [[Boltflare]] attack from [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|To Be Together}}\n\n[[Unnamed Suit 053]] used this spell in [[Peru]] to counter a [[Poisonfang|Raypulse]] attack from [[Zhalia Moon]], but Sophie's [[Shieldbreaker]] power disabled it, allowing Zhalia to hit the suit with a [[Poisonfang]] attack. {{source|Doorway to Huntik}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT= Straalvreter\n|FR = Mange-éclair\n|POR=Devora-raios, Devorador, Devora-fogo}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E13 Suits Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by [[Unnamed Suit 028]]\nS1E19 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by [[Unnamed Suit 041]]\nS2E27 Suit Blasteater.png|Blasteater used by one of [[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]]\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Green-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Green-aura spells","Magic","Organization magic","Protective spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-137","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:7836","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-137","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7836"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 004","label":"Unnamed Suit 004","target_id":"huntik:page:17523","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_004","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17523"},{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-137","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:7836","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-137","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7836"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 028","label":"Unnamed Suit 028","target_id":"huntik:page:17701","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_028","status":"resolved","hr